[00:13.50]Khairiyat puchho, kabhi toh kaifiyat puchho,
[00:20.00]Tumhare bin deewane ka kya haal hai
[00:27.00]Dil mera dekho, na meri haisiyat puchho,
[00:33.50]Tere bin ek din jaise sau saal hai
[00:40.50]Anjaam hai tay mera,
[00:44.00]Hona tumhe hai mera
[00:47.00]Jitni bhi hon dooriyan filhaal hain...
